      "writtenOn": "2017-09-26T18:03:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is pretty much a one off case, this function would never be compiled unless the random number generator changes and needs to be verified, this is why I felt it was not necessary to use a channel and to allow to disable this output - after all if it is compiled in it is because we want to see it.",
