      },
      "lineNbr": 1232,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001696
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-09-26T17:55:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe it\u0027s better to inline the contents of this function in place of your single call? Then you don\u0027t need static variables. Also, what if DCRYPTO_bn_generate_prime() is called multiple times (not sure if that\u0027s possible)?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1218,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 1232,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "68afa0f3143497311c9881aed07b65ca933a9c4a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
